<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/gokturk-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gokturk%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gokturk Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Tang China conquers the Eastern Khaganate and captures Illig Qaghan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/tang-dynasty"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tang%20Dynasty.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tang Dynasty</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Tang destroy the Eastern Turkic Khaganate; Taizong is hailed as Heavenly Khagan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/tocharians"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tocharians.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tocharians</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The monk Xuanzang visits Kucha and records about a hundred convents with more than five thousand monks</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/muhammad"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Muhammad.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Muhammad</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He marches on Mecca with 10,000 men and takes the city with minimal casualties</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/mecca"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mecca.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mecca</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Muhammad and about 10,000 followers enter and take the city</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-badr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Badr.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Badr</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Muhammad marches into Mecca, whose peaceful surrender Abu Sufyan helps to negotiate</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/taxila"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Taxila.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Taxila</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Xuanzang finds Taxila desolate and half ruined</span></li></ul></section>
